NHL94AGA - native Amiga 1200 AGA port of NHL '94 (see Credits.txt)

Needs: Kickstart 3.0 or newer, a 68020 or better, the AGA chipset (Amiga 1200, 4000, CD32
hardware). The port targets an A1200 with Fast RAM, and your own 1 MB NHL '94 cartridge dump
(NHL94ROM:nhl94.bin, RAM:nhl94.bin, beside the program, or on two floppies NHL94ROMA: and
NHL94ROMB:). Nothing from the cartridge is on this disk.

Boot this disk and it runs the game (NHL94VFY PLAY). Keyboard: cursor keys, Z = A, X = B,
C/Space/Return = C, P = Start, Esc quits. Joystick in port 2: fire 1 = B, fire 2 = A. CD32
pad: red B, blue C, yellow/green A, play Start. Records and playoffs are kept in NHL94.sav.
From a Shell: NHL94VFY <script> [SHOW|INTENT|AUDIO] runs the checks; NHL94AGA is the boot test.
Changelog.txt says what each version does.
